Note: `actualOutput.startsWith("hello")` and `actualOutput.endsWith(" hello")` are used to test the trimming of whitespace characters at the start and end respectively. Similarly, `actualOutput.startsWith("hello") && actualOutput.endsWith(" ")` is used to test both leading and trailing whitespaces being removed.
